%% Product discovery flow
flowchart TD
    Q[SearchQuery per item] --> R[Registry.healthy_adapters]
    R --> S1[adapter.search_products]
    R --> S2[adapter.search_products]
    S1 --> M[Merge offers by item]
    S2 --> M
    M --> V[quality.validate_offer]
    V -->|ok| K[Clean offers + confidence]
    V -->|hard fail| X[Reject + count]
    K --> RANK[RankingEngine.rank]
    X -.-> LOG[log rejected]
